ect? You mean a defect in a computer program?\" Xucun instantly understood her meaning. [4015] \"The hidden error in the program... Yes, it may truly be a program defect. The flaw in the program created by God is humanity.\" [4016] \"Like acne... It's a disease. Life itself is a disease. When the disease is cured, life disappears. Yes, for example, teacher. You like to sleep, don't you? The pleasure of sleep is truly remarkable. Why do we want to lose our consciousness? Isn't it because losing consciousness is our natural state? Isn't it uncomfortable to be awakened while sleeping? From an instinctual standpoint, awakening is uncomfortable. Being born is the same... So, newborn infants all cry... They don't want to be born...\"\n[4017] \"As far as I know, only Zoroaster (transliteration: Zoroaster, an Iranian prophet and founder of Zoroastrianism) was born laughing.\" [4018] \"You know so much... When Zoroaster was born, there were seven sages. Buddha didn't cry either. He took seven steps after being born... 7 is a lonely number... Those who understand loneliness don't cry.\" [4019] \"You must have cried when you were born.\" [4020] \"Hmm... How did it go?... I blinked my eyes deeply, and it was very attractive. However, my child cried when he was born.\" [4021] \"You didn't cry when they killed your child...\"\n[4022] \"Why? What reason? Is there a need to cry?\" [4023] \"Your spirit would not allow such a contradiction, wouldn't it?\" Shichiri deeply blinked her eyes, appearing quite charming, \"However, my child cried when he was born.\" [4024] \"You did those things to die, right?\" Shichiri asked nervously. [4025] \"Yes, it was the starting point of freedom...\"\n[4026] \"You'll turn yourself in to the police, right?\" [4027] \"If I turn myself in, it may not be a death sentence\u2026\" Shiki put her hands on her face, \"Can you tell me when the execution will be? I want to write my own death date on the calendar\u2026 Do you still have such a luxurious schedu