ut you killed your mother\u2026\"\n[3598] \"Ms. Nishiyama, it's something all living beings allow. \" Dr. Shiki said gently, \"Please stop crying\u2026 It's just how life should be, it's fate\u2026 Flowers wither for new seeds, mothers die for new egg bodies\u2026 It's not something to be sad about.\" [3599] \"Born in that room?\" Dr. Komuro asked, \"Who's child?\" [3600] \"New Director Naito's, I suppose\u2026\" Aoi took a breath, \"Dr. Makoto Shiki and Director Naito's child\u2026 You killed your mother and her uncle. No, you killed your parents! Why? Why?\" [3601] \"It's all broken, Ms. Nishiyama.\" Mrs. Akagi's tone was slightly cold, \"I understand. I'll tell you the truth.\" [3602] Mrs. Akagi's white cat toy car rose slightly, and everyone looked up. [3603] \"Dr. True Spring was pregnant at the age of 14\u2026 The father was New Vineyard Shinji.\" It seemed like another personality had appeared, and Mrs. Akagi's tone became emotionless, as if she were reading a paper, \"She told her father, Dr. True Spring Left Lung, and her mother, Dr. True Spring Mei Chien. It was a child between her uncle and her. But she didn't understand. She happily told her parents\u2026 But she never imagined that because of that, her parents would be so shocked and angry. That's the background of the murder case fifteen years ago\u2026 It was the first time that season was beaten and scolded by her parents\u2026 She didn't know what she had done wrong. No one had taught her about such rules\u2026 Her parents scolded and beat her. How unreasonable!\" [3604] \"So you killed them?\" Momo asked. Her voice was a little calmer than before. [3605] \"No\u2026\" Mrs. Akagi answered in a gentle voice, \"New Vineyard Shinji killed Dr. True Spring Left Lung and Dr. True Spring Mei Chien. That's the uncle of True Spring\u2026 It's different from what the world generally believes, but it's what Season saw, so it's true\u2026 Season watched her uncle kill her parents\u2026\"\n[3606] \"Shikiri was th