ld be easy to communicate. Something like that would be easy for the doctor to make. The parts and tools are there. Even I could make a simple transmitter-receiver.\" [3893] \"But it's the basement floor\u2026 The radio waves would be hard to send, wouldn't they?\" Water Val said. [3894] \"There's a TV, isn't there?\" Shishou smiled, \"That is, the TV antenna extends to this room. The cable of the antenna is not drawn from the roof, right? If you connect it to the wireless communicator, even a primitive and low-power circuit would be fine, wouldn't it? Maybe, that wireless communicator\u2026 inside that old TV. Maybe it shares the same parts with the TV. The TV that Arisawa Doctor carefully used before changing the vacuum tubes. The director could always talk to the doctor when he was alone in the helicopter\u2026\"\n[3895] \"In that case, the second murder case would be very simple to complete, and I think everyone can understand. At that time, Arisawa Doctor was disguised as Arisawa Future Miss and stayed in the research institute. It would take some time to investigate the abnormality of Red Magic, so the system would not be restarted, which was within her expectations. She had enough time to consider the method of escaping the research institute before the police arrived.\" [3896] \"The expressions of the people in the room became a little calmer. Detective Shizuka also listened to Kurosu's speech attentively, nodding like everyone else. Mariko leaned against the wall, with her arms crossed. Her eyes followed Kurosu. [3897] \"Then, there is nothing difficult to understand now.\" Kurosu lit another cigarette. One after another, that's the state of it. \"I think it's likely that Dr. Akagi's plan was to keep the deaths of the people in the research institute a secret. Just as Mr. Yanez thought, using Miss Akagi Futaba as a substitute for Dr. Akagi Akane. The victim of the murder incident was only Director Shinobu. This was also within Dr. Akagi's calculations. If t